96,northwest,"To complete the task of reaching the stairs down, I will first review my previous observations to identify any patterns or clues that may lead me to the stairs. Since I've already explored a significant portion of the level, I will focus on the dark areas and unexplored regions of the map. My plan is to methodically move in different directions, using my knowledge of the level's layout to guide my movements. I will prioritize searching for hidden doors, secret passages, or clues that may be concealed in the dark areas. If I encounter any obstacles, such as locked doors or enemies, I will use my available items and monk abilities to overcome them. I will also keep track of my health, mana, and inventory to ensure I'm adequately prepared for any challenges. By systematically exploring the level and utilizing my resources strategically, I aim to locate the stairs down and complete the task.","message:


